WEBVTT

00:00:03.191 --> 00:00:05.778
Now give the assistant the knowledge.

00:00:05.778 --> 00:00:10.291
Open the profile, open the Knowledge tab, and choose the data source.

00:00:10.747 --> 00:00:15.908
Restrict answers to retrieved data only keeps the assistant to your files.

00:00:15.908 --> 00:00:21.327
When nothing matches, it says so, instead of answering from general knowledge.

00:00:21.781 --> 00:00:27.525
Strictness is how closely a passage must match the question, and Retrieved documents

00:00:27.525 --> 00:00:29.886
is how many passages come back.

00:00:29.886 --> 00:00:30.971
Click Save.

